PROVISIONAL (owner decides): the names Scalar and scalar_of. typed::Access gets scalar_of by kind_of then text_of, which keeps its two
visits; the stocks probe does not instantiate it.
If the owner finds that it breaks 'No function does two things', C5 is dropped.
